{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>ATEEZ × I’m donut？聯名登場！</h2>\n<p>日本超人氣冬甩品牌「I’m donut？」再度出手，這次攜手韓國8人男子團體ATEEZ推出限時聯名企劃，以專輯《GOLDEN HOUR : Part.6》的世界觀為靈感，帶來一款聯名冬甩及限定毛毯周邊，勢必掀起ATINY的搶購熱潮。\n</p>\n<h2>黑白雲呢拿松露口味</h2>\n<p>本次主打聯名冬甩為「Black &amp; White Vanilla Truffle（黑白雲呢拿松露口味）」，將ATEEZ的色彩與氛圍，完整融入冬甩的設計之中。口感軟糯、咬感俐落，外層淋上呈現黑、白、灰大理石紋理的白朱古力塗層。白朱古力疊加雲呢拿籽與松露油的馥鬱香氣，層次豐富、風味獨特。每顆冬甩的大理石紋理皆獨一無二，極具收藏價值。</p>\n<h2>限定毛毯</h2>\n<p>除了聯名冬甩，本次亦同步推出限定周邊「I’m ATEEZ？毛毯」。毛毯以白色為基底，搭配可愛的生甜甜圈角色，畫面中的冬甩人張開雙臂、呈現討抱抱的模樣，旁邊印有「I’m ATEEZ？」字樣，療癒感十足。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524802490810748_10062618306b014f9955146.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524802490810748_10062618306b014f9955146.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524802676095658_13350309756b014f9b2520b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524802676095658_13350309756b014f9b2520b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524802878174011_12885023526b014f9d2ac1f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524802878174011_12885023526b014f9d2ac1f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524803051454703_16475898996b014f9ede1fe.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179524803051454703_16475898996b014f9ede1fe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df_m3i6E0sM/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.083818+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":528,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T08:00:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T08:57:25.484235+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:26.344736+00:00","content_hash":"6cc4ab678357b966f5cd20dd6aca8947303262e5c1f46ea52431b057824e164a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}